          "value": "<p><strong>Biotic Throw</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p><strong>Range</strong> 30 feet. One creature.</p><p>The commando seizes a target in a mass effect field and hurls them. The target must succeed at a Fortitude save (DC 22) or be moved up to 15 feet in any direction and knocked prone (also taking 2d6 bludgeoning damage on a critical failure). A successful save means the target is moved 5 feet and not knocked prone.</p>",
